# .gitignore  --  Rick and Morty - Multiverse Mayhem
#
# Strategy: ignore EVERYTHING, then allow back only the files that make up the
# source project. Anything not explicitly listed below stays out of the repo
# (build output, virtual envs, caches, save files, screenshots, archives,
# notes, old version copies, the changelog, etc.).

# 1) Ignore everything by default
*

# 2) ...but keep these (the code, the build script, the version info, the icon)
!.gitignore
!CHANGELOG.md
!README.md
!LICENSE
!Rick and Morty RPG.py
!BUILD_EXE.bat
!version.txt
!icon.ico

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# If you rename the game script, update the line above to match the new name.
# To also track the changelog, add:   !CHANGELOG.md
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------